[[Image:isk_x3_ride.png|right|Ride]]
The character has spent time training to use a horse in combat, and can perform actions unskilled people cannot.

*'''Ability:''' [[dexterity]]

*'''Classes:''' [[arcane archer]], [[barbarian]], [[blackguard]], [[champion of Torm]], [[fighter]], [[paladin]], [[purple dragon knight]], [[ranger]]

*'''[[Cross-class skill|Cross-class]]:''' yes

*'''[[Untrained skill check|Requires training]]:''' no

*'''Note:''' Horses and the ride skill are only used in the [[premium module]] "Neverwinter Nights - Wyvern Crown of Cormyr" and specific community-made modules.

==Notes==

*Added in the 1.69 [[patch]].
* One cannot take [[skill focus]] or [[epic skill focus]] in this skill. (This is probably an oversight.)
*See also [[mounted combat]] and [[horse riding]].

